{'symbol': 'NKE', 'date': '2023-05-09 16:15:00', 'title': 'MARIA HENRY TO JOIN NIKE, INC. BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "BEAVERTON, ORE.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NIKE, INC. (NYSE:NKE) TODAY ANNOUNCED MARIA HENRY HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS. HENRY WAS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER OF KIMBERLY-CLARK CORPORATION FROM APRIL 2015 THROUGH APRIL 2022, AND SERVED AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND SENIOR ADVISOR OF KIMBERLY-CLARK CORPORATION FROM APRIL 2022 UNTIL HER RETIREMENT IN SEPTEMBER 2022. “MARIA'S STRONG GLOBAL AND FINANCIAL LEADERSHIP, AS WELL AS HER STRATEGIC CONTRIBUTIONS ACROSS MULTIPLE INDUSTRIES,."}